{"id":"c92cae1596fbaf3e","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-projective-set.md","title":"Projective Set","display":"df-projective-set — Projective Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-projective-set","aliases":["92-df-projective-set"],"display":"df-projective-set — Projective Set","depends_on":["[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy]]"],"source":"原书之外的集合层级、可行计算或序数背景；未把这些条目归入该 PDF 的章节内容","source_status":"外部背景定义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-projective-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-projective-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projective-set — Projective Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"11736fadef5be849\" href=\"?note=11736fadef5be849\" title=\"92-df-analytical-hierarchy\">92-df-analytical-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的集合层级、可行计算或序数背景；未把这些条目归入该 PDF 的章节内容"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部背景定义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathcal N^k\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathcal N^k\\)</span> (subset of Baire space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (ambient finite power)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k),\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k))_{n\\geq1}\">\\((\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k),\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k))_{n\\geq1}\\)</span> (projective pointclasses, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11736fadef5be849\" href=\"?note=11736fadef5be849\" title=\"92-df-analytical-hierarchy\">92-df-analytical-hierarchy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Projective}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{Projective}_k\\)</span> (definition-target predicate on subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N^k\">\\(\\mathcal N^k\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Projective}_k(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\bigl(A\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k)\\cup\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Projective}_k(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\bigl(A\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k)\\cup\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>投射集：解析层级定义的集</li>\n<li>实数的子集</li>\n<li>可用解析公式定义</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1\">\\(\\Sigma^1_1\\)</span>投射集：解析集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\)</span>投射集：补解析集</li>\n<li>投射集的性质复杂</li>\n<li>Suslin定理：Borel = <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^1_1\">\\(\\Delta^1_1\\)</span></li>\n<li>大基数公理研究投射集</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-analytical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"11736fadef5be849","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-analytical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"11736fadef5be849","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k),\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k))_{n\\geq1}$ (projective pointclasses, see [[92-df-analytical-hierarchy]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathcal N^k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k),\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k))_{n\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Projective}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Projective}_k(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\bigl(A\\in\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n(k)\\cup\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n(k)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^1_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta^1_1","display":false}],"bytes":1236,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-projective-set]]"}],"outgoing":["11736fadef5be849"]}